NAME
    gcloud alpha number-registry discovered-ranges - manage discovered range
        resources

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud alpha number-registry discovered-ranges COMMAND
        [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (ALPHA) Manage discovered range resources.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     describe
        (ALPHA) Gets details of a single discovered range resource.

     find-free-ip-ranges
        (ALPHA) Find free IP ranges in a discovered range.

     list
        (ALPHA) List discovered range resources.

     show-utilization
        (ALPHA) Show utilization of a discovered range.

NOTES
    This command is currently in alpha and might change without notice. If this
    command fails with API permission errors despite specifying the correct
    project, you might be trying to access an API with an invitation-only early
    access allowlist.

